<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally weak on fairly good demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select and Choice rib, chuck and round cuts weak, while loin cuts uneven. Beef trimmings generally weak on mostly moderate demand and fairly heavy offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>361 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 86 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>24 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     106.10	106.09	 99.04	 98.34</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.43	 -0.26	 -0.71	 -1.12</p>
<p>Rib	  160.40	160.74	149.56	149.26</p>
<p>Chuck	 72.26	 70.64	 72.56	 70.02</p>
<p>Round	 90.61	 90.61	 85.56	 85.56</p>
<p>Loin	 174.77	176.84	152.17	152.63</p>
<p>Brisket     58.10	 58.10	 57.39	 57.39</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  65.74	 65.66	 65.99	 65.82</p>
<p>Flank	 58.93	 58.93	 58.22	 58.22</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
